# Raw downloads: 4.8 GB of DEM tiles, CHIRPS dailies and OSM extracts. Every one is
# re-fetchable by `python run_all.py` from a public URL with no credentials, so none of
# it belongs in the repository.
data/raw/

# Intermediates are regenerated by the build stages.
data/interim/

# data/final/ IS committed - it is 1.6 MB and it is what makes the analysis stages
# runnable without a cold download. `python run_all.py --from verify_benchmarks` works
# on a fresh clone because of this.

*.log
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
